NAME            SETOPT WINDOWAPI

DESCRIPTION     '@#OS2World:1.01#@##1## 25 May 2026 20:00:00     ARCAOS-507::::::v1.01@@SETOPT'

CODE            PRELOAD MOVEABLE
DATA            LOADONCALL MOVEABLE MULTIPLE READWRITE
